{"id":"68cd8d0cc7d0fe3a","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-satisfiable.md","title":"First-order satisfiability (legacy)","display":"df-satisfiable — First-order satisfiability (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-satisfiable","aliases":["27-df-satisfiable"],"display":"df-satisfiable — First-order satisfiability (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-satisfaction]]","[[27-df-sentence]]","[[27-df-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-satisfiable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-satisfiable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfiable — First-order satisfiability (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" href=\"?note=fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" title=\"27-df-satisfaction\">27-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b0b19b94b9984da\" href=\"?note=3b0b19b94b9984da\" title=\"27-df-sentence\">27-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span> 与句子满足见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea25e09b331cbbdb\" href=\"?note=ea25e09b331cbbdb\" title=\"27-df-structure\">27-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" href=\"?note=fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6\" title=\"27-df-satisfaction\">27-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li>引入该固定签名句子集上的谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSat}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSat}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSat}(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FOSat}(\\Phi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\mathfrak A\\;\\left[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>保留原一阶语义可满足性，与本书核心 BoolFunc 的 SAT 谓词分开。固定签名是本原子上下文参数，不把不同签名句子集混入同一个无语境判定问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"fe9edfb1d2ab3ed6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"3b0b19b94b9984da","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"ea25e09b331cbbdb","anchor":"r